# Feedium source seed list — topic: AI & technology news (RSS only)
#
# Format:  <feed_url>  [optional label/notes]
#   - First whitespace-separated token is the RSS feed URL (used as the
#     dedup key). Everything after it on the line is a human label.
#   - Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
#   - Trailing slashes are normalized away when comparing/creating.
#
# Seed with:  scripts/sources/seed-sources.sh
# Re-running is safe — already-registered feeds are skipped (idempotent).
#
# All feeds below were verified live (HTTP 200 + valid XML) on 2026-06-02.
# Re-check with: scripts/sources/check-feeds.sh

# ─────────────────────────── EN · AI-first (primary sources) ──────────────────
https://openai.com/news/rss.xml                              OpenAI — news/research
https://deepmind.google/blog/rss.xml                         Google DeepMind — blog
https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/ai/rss/     Google — AI blog
https://huggingface.co/blog/feed.xml                         Hugging Face — blog
https://bair.berkeley.edu/blog/feed.xml                      Berkeley AI Research (BAIR)
https://news.mit.edu/topic/mitartificial-intelligence2-rss.xml  MIT News — Artificial Intelligence
https://importai.substack.com/feed                           Import AI (Jack Clark) — weekly
https://simonwillison.net/atom/everything/                   Simon Willison — LLM/AI weblog

